      "activities": "00:00 - 06:00: Continued POOH with 3 1/2\" DP to 170 m.\n06:00 - 06:30: POOH from 170 m with 3 1/2\" DP.\n06:30 - 09:00: RIH with 4 stds of 3 1/2\" DP below BOP test tool. Od on XO sub below test tool was too big to enter 7\" CSG. Test plug was not seated. POOH and racked back 3 1/2\" DP.\n09:00 - 11:00: Unscrewed extension sub from BOP test tool. PU 9jts x 5\" HWDP from deck. RIH and seated BOP test tool.\n11:00 - 15:30: Tested BOP on blue pod. Tested all valves and rams to 20/345 bar. Tested annular to 20/241 bar. Function tested BOP on yellow pod.\n15:30 - 16:30: POOH with test tool. Function tested accustic system and shearram.\n16:30 - 19:00: Tested ibops on topdrive and stab-in valves to 20/345 bar.\n19:00 - 00:00: LD 70 jts of 5\" DP from derrick.\n",
