      "summary": "Rigged down logging equipment. Made clean-up/mud condition run inside 7\" casing to hight tension while logging). Reduced mudweight from 1,55 SG to 1,47 SG. Started to pull out of hole.",
      "activities": "00:00 - 02:00: Logged from 3556 m to 2592 m.\n02:00 - 04:00: POOH from 2592 m with logging tool.\n04:00 - 05:30: LD upper casing joint. LD logging tool and rigged down wireline.\n05:30 - 06:00: Changed bails and LD hang-off sub for logging shieve.\n06:00 - 08:00: L/d 7\" liner shooting nipple equipment. Broke and l/d stuffing box equip.\n08:00 - 10:00: Prepared for running atlas mac log. R/d atlas wireline.\n10:00 - 00:00: M/u and RIH w/ 5-7/8\" bit and 7\" CSG scraper for mud condtion/ clenaup run. Broke circ. Every 500 m. Circ. To condition mud. Recorded torque/ drag each 500 m. RIH to FC m). Treated mud. MW drifted back from 1,55 SG to 1,47 SG.\n",
